  "description": "ASP.NET Core MVC integration for Abblix OIDC Server, the certified OpenID Connect and OAuth 2.0 provider. Controllers, model binding and routing for every protocol endpoint: add it to a controller-based application and get a complete identity provider.",
  "iconFile": "Abblix.png",
